      { p: 'You are solely responsible for evaluating the Software, applying independent review, adding safeguards, and ensuring that any use of Your Work or Software output complies with applicable standards, laws, contracts, and customer requirements.' },
    ],
  },
  {
    h: '16. Disclaimer of Warranties',
