    h: '17. Limitation of Liability',
    blocks: [
      { p: 'TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, LAMAUTE LABS AND ITS OWNERS, OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, CONTRACTORS, AGENTS, AFFILIATES, LICENSORS, SERVICE PROVIDERS, PAYMENT PROCESSORS, AND SUPPLIERS WILL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, ENHANCED, PUNITIVE, OR SIMILAR DAMAGES; LOST PROFITS; LOST REVENUE; LOSS OF GOODWILL; LOSS OF BUSINESS; BUSINESS INTERRUPTION; LOSS OF DATA; DATA CORRUPTION; COST OF SUBSTITUTE SOFTWARE OR SERVICES; SECURITY INCIDENTS; DEVICE DAMAGE; THIRD-PARTY CLAIMS; OR OTHER LOSSES ARISING OUT OF OR RELATED TO THE SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES.' },
