      { p: 'Material changes will be posted on the Elysium UI website or presented through the Software, purchase flow, account portal, or other reasonable notice method.' },
    ],
  },
  {
    h: '23. Governing Law, Venue, and Dispute Resolution',
    blocks: [
      { p: 'This EULA is governed by the laws of the State of Washington, excluding conflict-of-law rules that would require the law of another jurisdiction. The United Nations Convention on Contracts for the International Sale of Goods does not apply.' },
