---

<Layout title="Elysium Designer — End User License Agreement">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-40 pb-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Lamaute Labs LLC</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-[700]">Elysium Designer — End User License Agreement</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[0.85rem] text-muted">Last updated July 3, 2026.</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/90">
      <p>
        <strong>Important notice:</strong> Please read this End User License
        Agreement carefully before downloading, installing, activating,
        accessing, or using Elysium Designer. By doing any of those things, or
        by clicking an acceptance button, you agree to this EULA. If you do not
        agree, do not install, activate, or use the Software.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Parties.</strong> This End User License Agreement (the
        &ldquo;EULA&rdquo;) is a legal agreement between Lamaute Labs LLC, a
        Washington limited liability company (&ldquo;Lamaute Labs,&rdquo;
        &ldquo;Company,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or
        &ldquo;our&rdquo;), and the person or entity that downloads, installs,
        activates, accesses, or uses Elysium Designer (&ldquo;you&rdquo; or
        &ldquo;your&rdquo;).
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Product covered.</strong> This EULA applies only to the Elysium
        Designer desktop software application, including any installers,
        updates, upgrades, patches, modules, sample files, templates,
        documentation, and related materials that we provide with or for that
        application (collectively, the &ldquo;Software&rdquo; or
        &ldquo;Designer&rdquo;).
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Separate open-source framework.</strong> The Elysium UI
        framework is open-source software distributed separately under the
        Apache License 2.0 or other license file included with that framework.
        Your use of the open-source framework is governed by its open-source
        license, not this EULA, except that our names, logos, and trademarks
        remain subject to our trademark and brand rules.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Acceptance by an organization.</strong> If you use the Software
        on behalf of a company, organization, or other legal entity, you
        represent that you have authority to bind that entity to this EULA. In
        that case, &ldquo;you&rdquo; includes that entity and the individual
        user.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">Summary of core commercial terms</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full min-w-[420px] border-collapse text-left text-[0.92rem]">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline text-muted">
              <th class="py-2.5 pr-4 font-[600]">Topic</th>
              <th class="py-2.5 font-[600]">Summary</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="[&_td]:py-2.5 [&_td]:pr-4 [&_td]:align-top [&_tr]:border-b [&_tr]:border-hairline/50">
            {
              summary.map(([topic, text]) => (
                <tr>
                  <td class="whitespace-nowrap font-[620]">{topic}</td>
                  <td>{text}</td>
                </tr>
              ))
            }
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      {
        sections.map((s) => (
          <>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">{s.h}</h2>
            {s.blocks.map((b) => (
              <>
                {b.p && <p>{b.p}</p>}
                {b.ul && (
                  <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
                    {b.ul.map((li) => (
                      <li>{li}</li>
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                )}
              </>
            ))}
          </>
        ))
      }

      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">25. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this EULA may be sent to
        <a class="text-iris hover:underline" href="mailto:support@elysiumui.com">support@elysiumui.com</a>.
      </p>
      <p>Lamaute Labs LLC, 704 228th Ave NE, #1154, Sammamish, WA 98074.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
